Model weights
================================================================================

The fine-tuned LoRA adapter published at
https://huggingface.co/mku1988/medgemma-ct-fibrosis is a Model Derivative of
MedGemma 1.5 4B (google/medgemma-1.5-4b-it). It has been modified from the
original by LoRA fine-tuning for pulmonary fibrosis classification on chest
CT slices.

HAI-DEF is provided under and subject to the Health AI Developer Foundations
Terms of Use found at https://developers.google.com/health-ai-developer-foundations/terms

Use of the model is subject to those Terms of Use, including the use
restrictions in Section 3.2 and the Prohibited Use Policy at
https://developers.google.com/health-ai-developer-foundations/prohibited-use-policy

The 4-bit base model used for training and inference is
unsloth/medgemma-1.5-4b-it-unsloth-bnb-4bit, a quantised copy of MedGemma 1.5
4B distributed under the same terms.

